DISCLAIMER = 'Independent editorial reference. No affiliation with NIST, NCCoE, NSA, ANSSI, ENISA, OWASP, or any standards body, regulatory authority, or certification organization. Not a standard, certification, or compliance scheme. Does not constitute legal, regulatory, financial, or security advice. Research assisted by AI tools, reviewed and validated before publication. Editorial responsibility: XB2 EURL, RCS Bayonne 922 532 320, France. All rights reserved; quotation with attribution and link welcome.'
